AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution 1 (EASU and RCAS) and CAS in the presenter without the FidelityFX SDK. Their shaders
are the SDK's own prebuilt bytecode, so only the temporal FSR 2/3 path still needs the SDK: present_effect accepts
bilinear, cas and fsr. The presenter's RTV heap also gets a slot for every intermediate image of the effect chain
(it had kGuestOutputMailboxSize - 1, two, while a chain can use kMaxGuestOutputPaintEffects - 1).
The same idea as king-kong-recompiled tools/rexglue-patches/0008 (TekRantGaming), which states no license, so this is
written independently from the SDK source and reuses none of its text.

